# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Installer tooling - deliberately kept out of the public repository.
#
# This is so the only TagCat installer in circulation is the official one from
# the Releases page. It does NOT stop anyone building or running the app: the
# source is all here and `dotnet build` works fine. It only means there is no
# ready-made script for producing an installer that looks official.
#
# NOTE TO SELF: these files exist only on your own machine now. If you ever
# re-clone this repo onto a new computer they will NOT come with it, so keep a
# backup somewhere outside the repo.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
TagCat.iss
BUILD-RELEASE.bat
MAKE-INSTALLER-PACKAGE.bat
MAKE-EXE.bat
Install.bat
Install.ps1
ExtractLibVlc.ps1

# IDE
.vs/
*.user
*.suo

# OS
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
